// RVV order    : bit (row j, col c) at  c * 64 + j                 -> qs[c] is column c as one 64-bit mask
// VD4DOT order : bit (row j, col c) at (c / 4) * 256 + 4 * j + c % 4 -> qs[4q .. 4q+3] is plane q: 4 cols x 64 rows"""

